stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="306" y1="1360" x2="354" y2="1360" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="646" y1="1360" x2="694" y2="1360" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="306" y1="1440" x2="354" y2="1440" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="646" y1="1440" x2="694" y2="1440" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="306" y1="1480" x2="354" y2="1480" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="646" y1="1480" x2="694" y2="1480" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="306" y1="1520" x2="354" y2="1520" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="646" y1="1520" x2="694" y2="1520" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="306" y1="1560" x2="354" y2="1560" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line><line x1="646" y1="1560" x2="694" y2="1560" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="5"></line></svg></div>
<div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div>
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="crumbs in d1"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Football Performance</span></li></ol></nav>
<h1 id="page-title" class="display page-title"><span class="solid in d1">Football</span><span class="accent in d2">Performance</span><span class="solid in d3">Training</span></h1>
<p class="lede in d3">Develop the speed, strength and movement your game demands. Train with Ben Pascoe on turf and in the gym across the Greater Toronto &amp; Hamilton Area, through group sessions or one-on-one coaching.</p>
<p class="audience-line in d3">For high school, university, Canadian Football League (CFL) and professional-level athletes.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas in d4">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#inquiry"><span>Find Your Training Fit</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
<a class="btn btn-glass" href="#formats"><span>Explore Training Options</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="page-media glass in d3">
<span class="hud tl" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="hud br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<div class="fb-video-wrap"><video class="fb-video" autoplay="autoplay" muted="muted" loop="loop" playsinline="playsinline" preload="metadata" poster="/media/football-performance-poster.jpg" aria-label="Ben Pascoe coaching football athletes through drills on indoor turf"><source src="/media/football-performance.webm" type="video/webm"><source src="/media/football-performance.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div>
<span class="media-bar" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="cred-strip" aria-label="Coach credentials">
<div class="wrap cred-row">
<div class="cred-item"><span class="cred-big">CSCS</span><span class="cred-txt">NSCA Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist</span></div>
<div class="cred-item"><span class="cred-big">10+</span><span class="cred-txt">Years of strength coaching experience</span></div>
<div class="cred-item"><span class="cred-big">100+</span><span class="cred-txt">Ontario University Athletics (OUA) varsity athletes coached</span></div>
<div class="cred-item"><span class="cred-big">All-Canadian</span><span class="cred-txt">Former linebacker · 2014 International Bowl MVP</span></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="who" aria-labelledby="who-title">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Who it's for</p>
<h2 id="who-title" class="display h2">High school to the pros</h2>
</div>
<p class="reveal r2">Training starts at high school age. Share your level of play and Ben will talk through what makes sense for you.</p>
</div>
<div class="audience">
<div class="a-card glass reveal">
<h3 class="display">High school athletes</h3>
<p>Build a foundation: learn sound technique on the turf and in the weight room, develop training habits that last, and grow your confidence as an athlete.</p>
<p class="fit-note"><b>For parents:</b> Ben leads every session, with support from other coaches. High school athletes train together in one small group, so each athlete gets attention. You're welcome to send the inquiry and join the first conversation.</p>
</div>
<div class="a-card glass reveal r2">
<h3 class="display">University athletes</h3>
<p>Add performance work that takes your team commitments into account, so extra training supports your season instead of competing with it.</p>
</div>
<div class="a-card glass reveal r3">
<h3 class="display">CFL &amp; professional athletes</h3>
<p>Training shaped around your individual development priorities and the timing and demands of your season.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section tone-3" id="focus" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Training focus</p>
<h2 id="focus-title" class="display h2">What you'll work on</h2>
</div>
<p class="reveal r2">The off-season is where next season is won. Develop your physical performance and build training habits that carry into game day.</p>
</div>
<ul class="goals">
<li class="goal glass reveal"><span class="goal-num">01</span><h3 class="display">Acceleration</h3><p>Work on your first steps, body position and drive mechanics to build a stronger start.</p></li>
<li class="goal glass reveal r2"><span class="goal-num">02</span><h3 class="display">Top speed</h3><p>Refine your sprint technique and learn to move efficiently as you reach full speed.</p></li>
<li class="goal glass reveal r3"><span class="goal-num">03</span><h3 class="display">Skill &amp; movement</h3><p>Develop footwork and body control through football-focused movement drills.</p></li>
<li class="goal glass reveal"><span class="goal-num">04</span><h3 class="display">Strength &amp; power</h3><p>Build the strength and explosive power needed for the physical demands of football.</p></li>
<li class="goal glass reveal r2"><span class="goal-num">05</span><h3 class="display">Consistent development</h3><p>Train with structure, receive feedback and review your progress as you go.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section tone-2" id="formats" aria-labelledby="formats-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Training options</p>
<h2 id="formats-title" class="display h2">Group or one-on-one</h2>
</div>
<p class="reveal r2">Two ways to train with Ben. Not sure which fits? Ask, and Ben will help you decide.</p>
</div>
<div class="formats">
<article class="format glass reveal" id="group-training">
<h3 class="display">Group Football Training</h3>
<p>Train with other football athletes in small-group sessions led by Ben, focused on shared training goals.</p>
<dl class="compare">
<div><dt>A good fit if</dt><dd>You like training alongside other athletes and want regular, structured sessions</dd></div>
<div><dt>Group size</dt><dd>Small classes, coached by Ben with support from other coaches</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="btn btn-glass" href="#inquiry" data-pick="group-football"><span>Ask About Group Training</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</article>
<article class="format glass reveal r2" id="one-on-one">
<h3 class="display">One-on-One Football Coaching</h3>
<p>Work directly with Ben on the areas you want to develop.</p>
<dl class="compare">
<div><dt>A good fit if</dt><dd>You have specific areas to work on or want individual attention</dd></div>
</dl>
<a class="btn btn-glass" href="#inquiry" data-pick="one-on-one-football"><span>Ask About One-on-One</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</article>
</div>
<p class="formats-note reveal">Both options train on turf and in the gym. <span class="ph-text">[Session length and scheduling for each format]</span></p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="coach" aria-labelledby="coach-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap coach">
<div class="coach-photo glass reveal">
<span class="hud tl" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="hud br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<div class="ben-video-wrap"><video class="ben-video" autoplay="autoplay" muted="muted" loop="loop" playsinline="playsinline" preload="metadata" poster="/media/meet-ben-poster.jpg" aria-label="Ben Pascoe coaching in the gym"><source src="/media/meet-ben.webm" type="video/webm"><source src="/media/meet-ben.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video></div>
</div>
<div class="coach-copy reveal r2">
<p class="kicker">Your coach</p>
<h2 id="coach-title" class="display">Coached by Ben Pascoe</h2>
<p>Ben is an NSCA Certified Strength and Conditioning Specialist and Certified Program Design Specialist with more than ten years of strength coaching experience.</p>
<p>He has coached over 100 Ontario University Athletics varsity athletes and spent more than five years coaching professional and semi-professional athletes across multiple sports. Before coaching, he played linebacker, earning All-Canadian honours and the 2014 International Bowl MVP.</p>
<a class="btn btn-glass" href="/about/"><span>More About Ben</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section tone-3" id="nutrition" aria-labelledby="nutrition-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap nutri">
<div class="nutri-copy reveal">
<p class="kicker">Nutrition support</p>
<h2 id="nutrition-title" class="display h2">Fuel your training</h2>
<p>What you eat affects how you train and how you recover. Ask Ben what nutrition guidance is included in your program.</p>
</div>
<div class="n-panel glass reveal r2">
<h3 class="display">Guidance can cover</h3>
<ul class="check-list">
<li>Eating to fuel training sessions</li>
<li>Recovery habits between sessions</li>
<li>Consistent routines through your season</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section camp" id="speed-and-skills" aria-labelledby="camp-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap camp-in">
<div class="reveal">
<span class="status">Previous camp format · Future dates not yet confirmed</span>
<h2 id="camp-title" class="display h2">Inside the Speed &amp; Skills Camp</h2>
<p class="camp-lede">Speed &amp; Skills is a camp within Football Performance Training. Here is how the previous camp was structured. A future camp's format may differ.</p>
</div>
<div class="facts-panel glass reveal">
<table class="facts">
<caption>Previous camp format</caption>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Duration</th><th scope="col">Frequency</th><th scope="col">Plan</th><th scope="col">Additional support</th></tr></thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td data-label="Duration"><b>3</b> months<small>Three-month program</small></td>
<td data-label="Frequency"><b>3×</b> a week<small>Three training sessions per week</small></td>
<td data-label="Plan">Customized<small>Customized training plan</small></td>
<td data-label="Additional support">Nutrition + scan<small>Nutrition consultation and body scan</small></td>
</tr></tbody>
</table>
<p class="help" style="position: relative; margin-top: 20px;">Focus: speed, skill, power, acceleration and top-speed mechanics.</p>
</div>
<div class="reveal">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="#inquiry" data-pick="group-football"><span>Ask About Upcoming Camps</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section tone-2" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Getting started</p>
<h2 id="how-title" class="display h2">What happens after you inquire</h2>
</div>
<p class="reveal r2">Sending an inquiry doesn't commit you to anything. It starts a conversation.</p>
</div>
<div class="steps">
<div class="step glass reveal">
<div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
<h3 class="display">Send an inquiry</h3>
<p>Share your level of play, what you want to improve and your general availability.</p>
</div>
<div class="step glass reveal r2">
<div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
<h3 class="display">Talk it through</h3>
<p>Ben follows up to discuss your goals, your season and whether group or one-on-one training fits best. <span class="ph-text">[CONFIRM: call, message or in person]</span></p>
</div>
<div class="step glass reveal r3">
<div class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
<h3 class="display">Start training</h3>
<p>Agree on a format and schedule, then get to work on the turf and in the gym.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Questions</p>
<h2 id="faq-title" class="display h2">Football performance questions</h2>
</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-list reveal">
<FaqList groups={faqs["football-performance"]} />
</div>
<p class="cross-link reveal">Not training for football? <a href="/personal-training/">Explore Personal Training</a></p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section tone-3" id="inquiry" aria-labelledby="inquiry-title">
<hr class="laser" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div class="reveal">
<p class="kicker">Start the conversation</p>
<h2 id="inquiry-title" class="display h2">Let's talk about your training</h2>
</div>
<p class="reveal r2">Share what you want to improve and which training option interests you. Ben will discuss the next step based on your goals and availability.</p>
</div>
<div class="inquiry-grid">
<InquiryForm preselect="" page="football-performance" />
<aside class="contact-card glass reveal r2" aria-label="Contact details">
<h3 class="display">Get in touch</h3>
<div class="c-row"><span class="c-label">Email</span><span class="c-val ph-text">[CONTACT EMAIL]</span></div>
<div class="c-row"><span class="c-label">Phone</span><span class="c-val ph-text">[CONTACT PHONE]</span></div>
<div class="c-row"><span class="c-label">Football training location</span><span class="c-val">Turf and gym · <span class="ph-text">[VENUE NAME]</span></span></div>
</aside>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
